  "sourceTitle": "SIMA 2: An Agent that Plays, Reasons, and Learns With You in Virtual 3D Worlds",
  "sourceBodyHash": "ded426813613ec396fc0d8cafa2280ac321c819418ea349cac334812565f3e7e",
